      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606272338558093_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606272338558093_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260627/202606272338558093_720.jpg"> </div><p>【世界杯战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/match1869208date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">头名出线！英格兰2-0巴拿马 贝林厄姆传射凯恩破门创纪录宽萨伤退</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260628/zhanbao_image_1869208_1782600081_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260628/zhanbao_image_1869208_1782600081_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260628/zhanbao_image_1869208_1782600081_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>英格兰2-0击败巴拿马，以小组头名出线，巴拿马三战皆负垫底出局。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/match1869209date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">第二出线！克罗地亚2-1加纳 苏契奇弗拉希奇破门 加纳第三出线</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260628/zhanbao_image_1869209_1782600682_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260628/zhanbao_image_1869209_1782600682_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260628/zhanbao_image_1869209_1782600682_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>克罗地亚队2-1击败加纳队。积分榜方面，克罗地亚队三战积6分排名L组第二，将在1/16决赛中迎战K组第二，加纳队积4分排在L组第三。</p><p>【世界杯比赛日相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a402ed4465e0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世界杯32强出炉29席：克罗地亚出线，韩国、伊朗待定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a40574a8175a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a40574a8175a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a40574a8175a.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛L组第3轮战罢，10个小组收官后，世界杯32强已出炉29队！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a40442e1b605native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">紧张算分时刻！若民主刚果取胜或乌兹别克6球大胜，韩国将被淘汰</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280349364154.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280349364154.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280349364154.jpg"> </div><p>K组的比赛，如果民主刚果取胜，或者乌兹别克斯坦以6球优势大胜，韩国将被淘汰。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a4054db14e87native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">黯然退场！巴拿马3连败从L组垫底出局 是本届世界杯唯一0进球队伍</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280655377991_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280655377991_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280655377991_720.jpg"> </div><p>巴拿马三连败从小组垫底出局。他们也是本届赛事中唯一没有进球的队伍。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a405644aca52native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">出局！苏格兰1胜2负3分无缘小组第3出线 队史世界杯从未小组出线</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280703438324_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280703438324_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280703438324_1280.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯小组赛L组第3轮结束，苏格兰确定无缘最好的8支小组第3，小组出局。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a404e95756f6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">11球！凯恩超越莱因克尔，独享英格兰队史世界杯射手王</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280628479279.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280628479279.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/202606280628479279.jpg"> </div><p>凯恩超过莱因克尔，以11球独享英格兰队史世界杯射手王。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a405d90df087native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">苏格兰无缘晋级！官方：苏格兰主帅史蒂夫·克拉克辞职</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220602/6298061381f61.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220602/6298061381f61.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_220602/6298061381f61.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，苏格兰主帅史蒂夫·克拉克辞职，苏格兰队未能从本届世界杯晋级。</p><p>【世界杯其他相关】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a40005d43cccnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：马宁担任德国vs巴拉圭第四官员，周飞担任候补助理裁判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2792f586f90.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2792f586f90.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260609/6a2792f586f90.jpg"> </div><p>FIFA官方确认，马宁担任德国vs巴拉圭第四官员，周飞担任候补助理裁判。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a4017c0d5ca1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴媒：佛得角队长莱恩·门德斯涉嫌强奸，正在接受警方调查</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a4017714ec23_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a4017714ec23.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a4017714ec23.jpg"> </div><p>巴西媒体《环球体育》报道，佛得角队长莱恩·门德斯因一名巴西女性的强奸指控，正接受新西兰警方调查。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a40368ea4e63native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴西球迷不满盐贝健人言论：日本球衣几颗星？下场不进5个不庆祝</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3c4ee1ee378_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3c4ee1ee378.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260625/6a3c4ee1ee378.jpg"> </div><p>此前日本队例行采访，日本前锋盐贝健人在采访中的言论引起了巴西球迷不满。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a4018e6b0fd3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">耻辱出局！记者：乌拉圭队取消包机，球员们将自行坐飞机返程</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a4019478fb3d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a4019478fb3d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a4019478fb3d.jpg"> </div><p>乌拉圭末轮不敌西班牙，无缘晋级世界杯32强。记者Martin Charquero透露了乌拉圭足协的决定。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a401ff25a195native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西班牙官方：尼科内收肌受伤、皮诺肩锁关节扭伤，两人将继续随队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a402219de7eb_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a402219de7eb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260628/6a402219de7eb.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙足协官方通报，尼科·威廉姆斯右侧内收肌出现肌肉损伤，皮诺左肩肩锁关节扭伤。两人将留队继续观察伤情。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-28/6a4012fe5e574native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">荷兰官方：对遭丧子之痛的加克波表示慰问 球员决定留队继续比赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.du